<title>INDIA: KPMG to study India Dena Bank revamp.</title>
<headline>KPMG to study India Dena Bank revamp.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's state-run Dena Bank said on Wednesday it appointed international management consultant KPMG Peat Marwick to assist the bank in its business transformation and restructuring.</p>
<p>&quot;It is planning to examine new business opportunities to create a competitive edge,&quot; the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>Dena Bank share was trading 0.50 rupees up at 24 rupees on the Bombay Stock Exchange on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
